Page 2 - Dashboard 
● Purpose: Analyze payroll over time and compare payroll and performance across 
departments. 
● Suggested slicers: Year and Job Level. 
● Recommended KPI cards: Total Salary Paid, Salary Paid - Previous Year, and Average 
Performance Score. 
● Note: Previous-year comparisons are meaningful when analyzing 2025 because the dataset 
begins in 2024. 
